SUMMARY: for the multiset {0,1,1} (the free vs transverse polarization at k=(0,1,1)2pi/L) the angular difference is exactly -119/450 at L=2 (landed prior art), is not symmetry-forced to vanish, and is not resolved from zero by seed-level estimates at L=4,6,8 whose errors (~1e-3) follow the measured tau_int~1.5 loops.
